# Constructor annotation: ConstructorName@[...] in [type ...] body (T-1052)
# Priority 2b: Union + ImmediateAt → Dict frame. The annotation PropertyDict is captured
# on the constructor tag node in the AST as SurfaceExpression::Annotated.
# Type resolution strips the annotation and uses "Union" as the constructor tag.
[Color: [type Union@[guarding: False]: [types: String]]]
=== out
["Color": [type Union@["guarding": False]: ["types": String]]]
